---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icons from '../../components/Icons.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Image with Deep Learning | Dr. Ovide Decroly">
  <section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <a href="/books" class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 hover:underline mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1">
        <span>&larr; Back to Books</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase">In Preparation</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">2026</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-2">
        Image with Deep Learning
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        A technical monograph and practical guide on digital image processing, convolutional neural networks, and real-time YOLO object detection.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs font-mono mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200">
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px] uppercase">Author</span>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Dr. Ovide Decroly Wisnu Ardhi</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px] uppercase">Research Domain</span>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Computer Vision & Deep Learning</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px] uppercase">Status</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-800 font-bold">In Preparation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Disusun khusus sebagai buku rujukan teknis dan praktikum bagi mahasiswa ilmu komputer serta peneliti rekayasa perangkat lunak dalam memahami arsitektur neural networks untuk visi komputer modern.
      </p>

      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="/pdf/buku-image-deep-learning.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded transition-colors">
          <Icons name="download" class="w-4 h-4" />
          <span>Download Preview PDF</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/books" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-bold text-xs rounded border border-slate-200 transition-colors">
          <span>All Publications</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
        Materi & Cakupan Riset
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-6 text-xs text-slate-600">
        <li><strong>Modul 1:</strong> Representasi Matriks Citra Digital dan Operasi Preprocessing</li>
        <li><strong>Modul 2:</strong> Arsitektur Dasar Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)</li>
        <li><strong>Modul 3:</strong> Evolusi Deteksi Objek: Dari R-CNN hingga YOLOv8/YOLOv10</li>
        <li><strong>Modul 4:</strong> Segmentasi Semantik Citra Medis dan Mikroskopik</li>
        <li><strong>Modul 5:</strong> Deployment Model ke Perangkat Edge dan Web Interface</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
